        {
            "guidStr": "222a689d-9135-4726-b59e-82f6f374da28",
            "name": [
                "Name",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "isLive": false,
            "metadata": "",
            "deleted": false,
            "type": "Body",
            "topMarginOverride": 20,
            "bottomMarginOverride": -1,
            "leftMarginOverride": -1,
            "rightMarginOverride": -1,
            "title": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "body": [
                "Krueger was born again in fire. As he emerged from the magma, he saw robed figures with arms outstretched in supplication, words in the dragon tongue pouring from their mouths in a torrent of alien blasphemy. They were led by a twisted, winged creature, its ghastly silhouette painted in burnt orange and yellow.\n\"Brothers and sisters! Behold our champion!\"\nMemories slammed into Krueger. Death and ruin raining down on a vast infernal army as he soared above a great yawning gate. He hurled lightning at his foes, reducing them to billowing ash, or slashed and skewered them with Wurmtongue, but there were too many. His last memory was of falling from the heavens, bleeding from a dozen mortal wounds, his final thought, <I>So much more I wished to accomplish.</I>\nThe memories faded, and his present reality crashed into him. He hovered above a bubbling pool of magma and gripped a length of chain, the metal cherry red from immersion in the fiery earth. At the end of the chain hung a small cage of brass and iron that held a jagged, multi-faceted crystal.",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "colorHex": "",
            "textColorHex": "",
            "mediaPath": "",
            "widthPerc": 100,
            "mediaWidth": 0,
            "mediaHeight": 0,
            "caption": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "isSub": false,
            "helpTermSorting": [],
            "helpTermIds": []
        },
        {
            "guidStr": "e1cc4c4c-b003-42bd-9049-57abd0da1469",
            "name": [
                "Name",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "isLive": false,
            "metadata": "",
            "deleted": false,
            "type": "Body",
            "topMarginOverride": -1,
            "bottomMarginOverride": -1,
            "leftMarginOverride": -1,
            "rightMarginOverride": -1,
            "title": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "body": [
                "The crystal pulsed, and Krueger’s mind nearly broke apart beneath an onslaught of images.\n<I>. . . a great battle raged below him, men and machines milling at his feet as he scorched them away . . . </I>\n<I>. . . a howling screech from a low hill where an ancient artifact channeled hatred and evil into unholy power. . . </I>\n<I>. . . his voice, the crash of thunder and ruin, conjuring power to match that of his adversary . . . </I>\n<I>. . . a great seizure of agony, his flesh parting, his talons folding around something hard and unyielding . . . </I>\n<I>. . . darkness rising, defeat, but also grim satisfaction . . . </I>\nKrueger sucked in a breath of scorched air and collapsed at the side of a pool of magma. He pressed his hands to his head, moaning in pain, trying to hold his mind together beneath the shredding assault of memories not his own.\n\"Be calm,\" the twisted creature said, crouching over Krueger. Its bestial face was a lopsided mixture of man and dragon—a blunt fang-filled snout beneath disturbingly human eyes. \"The pain will pass.\"",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "colorHex": "",
            "textColorHex": "",
            "mediaPath": "",
            "widthPerc": 100,
            "mediaWidth": 0,
            "mediaHeight": 0,
            "caption": [
