        {
            "guidStr": "e0c14303-02ff-42bc-af3b-7cf4c4bfaf0a",
            "name": [
                "Name",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "isLive": false,
            "metadata": "",
            "deleted": false,
            "type": "Body",
            "topMarginOverride": -1,
            "bottomMarginOverride": -1,
            "leftMarginOverride": -1,
            "rightMarginOverride": -1,
            "title": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "body": [
                "Krueger climbed to his feet, still clinging to the vessel that contained Blighterghast’s essence. More images flowed into his mind. This time, they were more orderly, and he gained an understanding of the last decade in an instant. The aftermath of the infernal invasion, the arrival of the Orgoth, western Immoren consumed by war yet again.\n\"Do the others know? Halfaug? Scaefang? Ashnephos?\" Krueger rattled off the names of the nearest dragons committed to the alliance against Toruk, their progenitor.\n\"Of course,\" Velchev said. \"The pact remains in force, but you must find allies elsewhere.\"\nAnother image filled Krueger’s mind. A Cygnaran warcaster astride an armored destrier, a great galvanic blade clenched in her fist, a living spark of azure lightning. She led a charge on the same scorched battlefield he’d seen before, through the Orgoth host, toward the figure on the hill and the terrible artifact that had . . .\n<I>Killed me,</I> came a thought not quite his own. \"Who is she?\"\n\"Captain Madison Calder,\" Velchev said. \"She was there when our master fell. She saw how the Orgoth witch overcame him.\"",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "colorHex": "",
            "textColorHex": "",
            "mediaPath": "",
            "widthPerc": 100,
            "mediaWidth": 0,
            "mediaHeight": 0,
