        },
        {
            "guidStr": "c48fda75-a6d3-4f0d-9e0e-4ce4ad59187e",
            "name": [
                "Name",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "isLive": false,
            "metadata": "",
            "deleted": false,
            "type": "Body",
            "topMarginOverride": -1,
            "bottomMarginOverride": -1,
            "leftMarginOverride": -1,
            "rightMarginOverride": -1,
            "title": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "body": [
                "\"What is it?\" Kommander Savaryn said, one hand resting on the titanic red bulk of a Great Bear warjack.\nCalder sat astride a new warhorse, but she hadn’t the heart to name this one yet. \"I think a more important question is who.\"\nThe figure she’d spied earlier had drawn within a hundred yards of Blighterghast’s corpse. She and the rest of the allied forces had gathered there, nearly a thousand soldiers with supporting warjacks and cavalry. If the army arrayed against it concerned the flaming apparition, it didn’t show.\nCalder could now see it wore archaic plate armor of enameled green and chased with brass. A voluminous emerald cloak fluttered from its back, the cloth seemingly proof against its owner’s burning halo. A bronze mask covered the figure’s face, and only its eyes, twin motes of searing red, were visible. It did not appear to be armed, but it carried a huge shard of crystal bound inside a cage of brass and iron at the end of a long length of chain.\n\"That is the armor of a blackclad druid,\" Savaryn said, \"though I know of no member of that group who fits this description.\"",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "colorHex": "",
            "textColorHex": "",
            "mediaPath": "",
            "widthPerc": 100,
            "mediaWidth": 0,
            "mediaHeight": 0,
            "caption": [
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                "",
                ""
            ],
            "isSub": false,
